# ─── CI/CD secrets (set in GitHub repository secrets) ────────────────────────
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN  — from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/account/tokens
# SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD   — your Supabase project database password
# SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID    — your Supabase project reference ID
# VERCEL_TOKEN           — from: https://vercel.com/account/tokens
# VERCEL_ORG_ID          — from: vercel.com project settings
# VERCEL_PROJECT_ID      — from: vercel.com project settings
# EXPO_TOKEN             — from: https://expo.dev/accounts/[account]/settings/access-tokens
